  "title": "Caper Chicken Cacciatore",
  "description": "Basic cacciatore--tomato, onion and mushrooms in wine -is made grand with capers, pepperoni and olives. It is a terrific party entree, and takes additions and substitutions well.",
  "authors": [
    "JoAnn M. Jarrach"
